# Arithmetic that can leave the target bounds: {a: 0} gives -1 (#20).
-- source.cue --
a!: uint
-- target.cue --
n!: uint
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {n: v0_0.a - 1}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.n is v0_0.a - 1, which may be as low as -1, where the target schema requires >=0 (rule computed-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:11
